  "question": {
    "text": "<p>There are two radioactive substances <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math>. Decay constant of <math><mi>B</mi></math> is two times that of <math><mi>A</mi></math>. Initially, both have an equal number of nuclei. After <math><mi>n</mi></math> half lives of <math><mi>A</mi></math>, rate of disintegration of both are equal. The value of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is</p>",
